{
  "id": "01-primitive-anatomy",
  "title": "一个原语的三段式生命周期",
  "caption": "同一条 T.copy 从 Python 前端到目标指令要走三段：前端组装 IR、IR 记住意图、后端按 target 与注解选指令。",
  "kind": "flow",
  "direction": "LR",
  "nodeMaxEm": 18,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "user",
      "label": "用户代码",
      "code": "T.copy(A[i,j], A_s)",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "front",
      "label": "前端函数",
      "sub": "校验 + extent 归一化",
      "code": "language/copy_op.py",
      "tone": "default"
    },
    {
      "id": "tir",
      "label": "TIR intrinsic",
      "sub": "tl.tileop.copy",
      "tone": "accent"
    },
    {
      "id": "ir",
      "label": "IR 节点",
      "sub": "CopyNode{src, dst, src_range, dst_range, annotations}",
      "tone": "accent"
    },
    {
      "id": "sel",
      "label": "后端指令选择",
      "sub": "SelectCopyInstForLowering",
      "tone": "compute"
    },
    {
      "id": "simt",
      "label": "SIMT 循环",
      "tone": "compute"
    },
    {
      "id": "cpasync",
      "label": "cp.async",
      "tone": "compute"
    },
    {
      "id": "tma",
      "label": "TMA cp.async.bulk.tensor",
      "tone": "compute"
    },
    {
      "id": "ldsm",
      "label": "ldmatrix / stmatrix / tcgen05.ld",
      "tone": "compute"
    },
    {
      "id": "asc",
      "label": "tl.tileop.ascend_copy",
      "tone": "store"
    },
    {
      "id": "ascdma",
      "label": "DataCopy / ND2NZ / LoadData / Fixpipe",
      "tone": "store"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "from": "user",
      "to": "front"
    },
    {
      "from": "front",
      "to": "tir"
    },
    {
      "from": "tir",
      "to": "ir"
    },
    {
      "from": "ir",
      "to": "sel"
    },
    {
      "from": "sel",
      "to": "simt"
    },
    {
      "from": "sel",
      "to": "cpasync"
    },
    {
      "from": "sel",
      "to": "tma"
    },
    {
      "from": "sel",
      "to": "ldsm"
    },
    {
      "from": "ir",
      "to": "asc",
      "label": "昇腾",
      "dashed": true
    },
    {
      "from": "asc",
      "to": "ascdma"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Python 只在最左边一列起作用：越往右，能影响的只剩 annotations 里的几个键。",
    "前端大部分时候只把参数变成 region；唯一的例外是标量 copy，两边都是无 extent 的 BufferLoad 时，直接退化成 BufferStore。"
  ]
}
